@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #164E63
skinparam actorBorderColor #164E63
skinparam actorFontColor #164E63
skinparam usecase {
 BackgroundColor #164E63
 BorderColor #164E63
 FontColor #164E63
}
skinparam rectangle {
 BorderColor #164E63
 FontColor #164E63
}
title Resumefolio | Mail and calendar use cases
actor "Connected-account user" as user
actor "Gmail service" as gmail
actor "Google Calendar service" as calendar
rectangle "Resumefolio | System boundary" {
 usecase "Read correspondence\nUC-D06-READ" as read [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d06-read]]
 usecase "Send a manually prepared message\nUC-D06-SEND" as send [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d06-send]]
 usecase "Manage a calendar activity\nUC-D06-ACTIVITY" as activity [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d06-activity]]
 usecase "Synchronize selected calendar information\nUC-D06-SYNC" as sync [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d06-sync]]
}
user -- read
user -- send
user -- activity
user -- sync
gmail -- read
gmail -- send
calendar -- sync
legend bottom
Sources: EGC-D03-D12 and UC-D06 refinements.
Local activity management does not imply every activity is synchronized.
Provider permissions, synchronization policy and actual access remain to be established.
Associations show proposed external interactions, not permission grants.
No include/extend dependency or actor inheritance is asserted.
endlegend
@enduml
